<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>North Paulina Peak from Ten-Mile Sno-Park</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:283-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.707204" lon="-121.326816"><ele>1702.7</ele><name>Ten-Mile Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:paulina-sno-park (OSM way 306294846 Ten Mile Sno-Park), as in 282-3; confidence: high; pdf_page: 283; book_elev_ft: 5600; quote: map 64: TEN-MILE SNO-PARK 5600'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.712347" lon="-121.277964"><ele>1934.6</ele><name>Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge)</name><desc>source: OSM road 21 node 38373784, as in 282-3; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 285; book_elev_ft: 6331; quote: From near the outlet-stream bridge near the resort turn left (west) up a short road that turns north</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.713080" lon="-121.277830"><ele>1934.3</ele><name>Crater Rim Trail #3957 start</name><desc>source: OSM node 38307731, west end of Crater Rim Trail #3957 (way 306294828) beside the resort road; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 285; quote: This is the beginning of the snowmobile route up the north rim and your route to several fine views</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.743700" lon="-121.247600"><ele>2285.3</ele><name>Turnaround in thick forest, about 7,500 ft</name><desc>source: OSM node 3111629812 on Crater Rim Trail #3957, 3.6 mi from its start, DEM 7498 ft; North Paulina Peak summit (OSM node 357312914, DEM 7685) is 500 m NE; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 285; book_elev_ft: 7500; quote: Beyond the views you will find thick forest to the top and no views, which makes this place, at about 7,500 feet, a good turnaround point</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>North Paulina Peak from Ten-Mile Sno-Park</name><desc>1. Ten-Mile Sno-Park -&gt; Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge): osm (medium), 2.75 mi | 2. Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge) -&gt; Crater Rim Trail #3957 start: osm (medium), 0.07 mi | 3. Crater Rim Trail #3957 start -&gt; Turnaround in thick forest, about 7,500 ft: osm (medium), 3.61 mi</desc>
